            "ClerkNotes": "Defense exhibit. Strong academic testimony. The 40% hazing statistic is jarring. The \u0027explain, not excuse\u0027 framing is effective. The prosecution\u0027s cross-examination was fair but didn\u0027t land any knockout blows. This evidence humanizes the defendants and contextualizes their behavior without excusing it — which is exactly what the defense needs.",
            "MediaType": "Document",
